@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

autonumber

actor "User"
participant "Планета Кіно" as C
participant "Security Service" as Sec
participant "Booking" as B
participant "Timer"
participant "Payment Service" as P
database "Store" as db
participant "Bank" as bank
== Authentication ==

User -> Sec: Authentication Request
Sec -> db: Validate user info

== Reservation ==
activate B

User -> B: Select seating place
User -> B: Book place(s)
B->Timer: Set timeout(15)
B->db: Mark occupied
deactivate B

== Purchase ==
activate P
User->P: start payment
P->bank: redirect
bank --> P: confirm
P->db: Mark bought
P-->User: confirm (Email)
deactivate P

== No Purchase ==
activate B
Timer [#red]->B:Cancel
B [#red]->db: Mark available
deactivate B

@enduml